    "intro_narrative": "The grand airship 'Aethelgard' is plummeting toward the jagged peaks of the Rust Mountains. As the Chief Engineer, you've been locked inside the main engine room by a saboteur. The steam pressure is reaching critical mass, and the automated navigation systems are completely offline. You must repair the complex web of mechanical computers, brass gears, and pneumatic tubes scattered across the room. Your ultimate goal is to reboot the Main Engine Console before the ship crashes into the mountainside. Time is ticking, and the hissing of steam is your only companion.",
    "narrative_style": "steampunk"
  },
